---
const metrics = [
  { value: "3", label: "Produits SaaS" },
  { value: "4+", label: "Secteurs" },
  { value: "99.9%", label: "SLA target" },
];
---

<section id="top" class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl border-surface-border px-6 md:border-x"
  >
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl pb-24 pt-24 text-center sm:pt-32">
      <span
        class="animate-rise inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-solid!! border-surface-border bg-surface px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wide text-text-secondary"
      >
        EST. 2025 • VENTURE STUDIO
      </span>

      <h1
        class="animate-rise mt-6 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text-primary sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
        style="animation-delay: 90ms"
      >
        Architectures <span class="gradient-text"
          >financières et logicielles</span
        > de demain.
      </h1>

      <p
        class="animate-rise mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-balance text-base leading-relaxed text-text-secondary sm:text-lg"
        style="animation-delay: 180ms"
      >
        Nous concevons des infrastructures SaaS souveraines pour les marchés
        émergents — pensées pour durer, pas pour un cycle de levée.
      </p>

      <div
        class="animate-rise mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row"
        style="animation-delay: 270ms"
      >
        <a
          href="#portfolio"
          class="w-full rounded-md bg-lehmora px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-lehmora/90 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Explorer le portfolio
        </a>
        <a
          href="#contact"
          class="w-full rounded-md border border-solid! border-surface-border px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-text-primary transition-colors hover:border-text-muted sm:w-auto"
        >
          Contacter le studio
        </a>
      </div>

      <dl
        class="animate-rise mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-lg grid-cols-3 divide-x divide-surface-border border-y border-surface-border"
        style="animation-delay: 360ms"
      >
        {
          metrics.map((metric) => (
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1 px-4 py-5">
              <dt class="order-2 text-xs text-text-muted">{metric.label}</dt>
              <dd class="order-1 font-mono text-2xl font-medium text-text-primary sm:text-3xl">
                {metric.value}
              </dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
